                address  : Königsallee 60  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://koegalerie.com/index.php/en/home  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : The extensive shopping gallery fills up most the block between Steinstraße and Grünstraße, with multi-level indoor passages featuring exquisite boutiques, as well as a REWE supermarket and a selection of bars, cafes and restaurants. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
