                <description>
                category  : Buy &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Königsallee 18  &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : At the corner of Königsallee and Schadowstraße, the six-level store of the Meyersche Buchhandlung (bookstore) chain will most likely be on your way at some point, filled with books, magazines, DVDs and other media. Worth visiting even for the views from the upper-level windows in all directions. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#165</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2282">
                    <coordinates>6.77979,51.22532,0.0</coordinates>
