            <Placemark id="2295">
                <name>Getränkemarkt El Charip </name>
                <description>
                category  : Buy &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Gubener Straße 59  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : https://charip.de/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : You can find all the special types of beer and spirits from Düsseldorf at this store, which is one of the oldest owner-managed beverage markets in Düsseldorf. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#165</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2294">
                    <coordinates>353.15058,51.21887,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
            <Placemark id="2297">
                <name>Löwensenf </name>
                <description>
                category  : Buy_Local specialties &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Berger Straße 29  &lt;br&gt;
                url  : http://www.loewensenf.de/  &lt;br&gt;
                description  : One of the most famous producers of German Mustard is situated in Düsseldorf. Moveover, a special mustard store, with a mustard tasting area, is based in the Düsseldorf-Altstadt (some fancy mustards are available at this place: for example &quot;Altbier Mustard&quot;, &quot;Chilli Mustard&quot;, &quot;Strawberry Mustard&quot;, etc.) &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#165</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2296">
                    <coordinates>6.77237,51.22408,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
            <Placemark id="2299">
                <name>Zum Kochlöffel </name>
                <description>
                category  : Eat_Budget_City centre &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Friedrich-Ebert-Str. 41  &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Very good German home cooking. You can go here for sandwiches to meals. Individual daily specials are being presented every day. Tasty and freshly prepared with passion.  &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#81</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2298">
                    <coordinates>6.7899253,51.2213633,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
            <Placemark id="2301">
                <name>Ham Ham bei Josef </name>
                <description>
                category  : Eat_Budget_City centre &lt;br&gt;
                address  :  Kurze Str. 5 &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : Real hearty German home cooking. Very good and varied food, and magnificent attention. They have the best pork rolls in Düsseldorf and they are made like 40 years ago. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#81</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2300">
                    <coordinates>6.7728195,51.2267076,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
            <Placemark id="2303">
                <name> Schweine Janes Altstadt </name>
                <description>
                category  : Eat_Budget_City centre &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Bolkerstraße 13  &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : A great place to taste the flavors of a good simple cuisine that evokes the stories of the old city. Small restaurant with freshly roasting pork knuckles near the window that is popular. Delicious and satisfying. Portions are big. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#81</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2302">
                    <coordinates>6.7729258,51.2260622,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
            <Placemark id="2305">
                <name>Ludwigs Bier&amp;Brot </name>
                <description>
                category  : Eat_Budget_City centre &lt;br&gt;
                address  : Mertensgasse 11  &lt;br&gt;
                url  :   &lt;br&gt;
                description  : One of the gastronomic establishments where every guest is warmly welcomed. The sexual orientation, culture, religious affiliation, are not assessed here, only you as an independent individual. The audience is open to the world and ranges from TV chef, top star from the sports and music scene to Düsseldorf's veteran and trade fair guest. The drinks and the food are very good and have reasonable prices. &lt;br&gt;
                </description>
                <styleUrl>#81</styleUrl>
                <Point id="2304">
                    <coordinates>6.7736594,51.2265581,0.0</coordinates>
                </Point>
            </Placemark>
            <Placemark id="2307">
                <name>Pizzeria Lupo </name>
